Well it started out auspiciously enough. Early wish from a lamp for a +2
GDSM, then the amulet from sokoban. Nothing else was speical for a long
time. None the less I was doing well. Payed heavy for protection, and it was
worth every zorkmid. As I descended I found a bones level provided by
hearse. I used to think what use is a bones level that deep. Well this one
had the much neaded bag of holding and a 3rd magic lamp. My second and third
magic lamps were cursed so I just used them for light. An alter provided me
with Cleaver as I was a barbarian and that worked for now. Mapped out the
levels down to medusa and decided I wanted a better weapon. Went back to the
alter for a sac fest. Well lets just say Crom has an odd idea of what I
need. Saced for a long time, finaly I got giantslayer. Ok... Some more, the
troll killing thing. Well this sucks. Saced for a long time and got vorpal.
Saced for a long time more and it looked like the well had ran dry. I wanted
to use a shield so I guess I was stuck with vorpal. Also got crowned. Made
easy work of the quest and then made a stupid wish. On a previous game I
wished for something I wanted as opposed to something I needed.  Thus I was
missing levitation. This time I wished for boots of levitation, the next
turn I realized I wanted a ring. Oh well. Killed medusa, wen't up to sokoban
for a little homecoming with the fine ladies of the 4077 and did the castle.
I had a ring of conflict, which I had used to good success in Ludious which
I found accidently. The castle fell the same way. Ah the wand of wishing.
Ided it, just to see what it had. Had charging scrolls so I wished for speed
boots and a shield of reflection as neither had shown up yet. Then I thought
and wished for Guantlets of power. In the levels below the castle I found
both speed boots and guantlets of power.


Went back to an alter to enchant my weapons, Vorpy and a Silver saber and
got them up to +6. Also enchanted armor and got my ac to -30.
 Descended into Gehehnom. No problems, went all the way to the bottom. Had
some problems finding Vlad but the nice people at RGRN helped me out. Had
the vibrating spot marked and was ready to kill the wizard. Then I realized
I made the best mistake of the game. I forgot the candles. I returned to the
minetown. Not only did this give me a chance to kill about 5 demon lords,
who had mere escaped. It also gave me a chance to remap the levels I forgot.

Molochs sanctum. Here was my first death. I got slimed. I looked at it for a
long time. Was this it, was I going to die? What cures slime? Unicorn horn,
tried it a few times and no luck. Then I remembered after reading the
spoilers. Well needless to say I didn't have any way to get rid of the slime
on me. Maybe I can make it back to the stairs, there was a way to remove it
surrounding the stairs. Well needless to say I ran for the stairs and knew I
wasn't going to make it. Here it comes. I turn to slime but what's this my
amulet begins to glow. Wow I forgot I had that. This is far superior to
having the AolS in the inventory and dieing.

The priest got neemed with a wand of death, after I discovered that Moloch
is quite protective of him.

The outer planes, or as I like to say "Like this game wasn't enough of a
pain in the ass as it was."

Earth was no problem. The humor of killing an animated pile of rock with a
saber was not much levity.

Air was not much problem. Horror stories aside, I had read a lot of them.
Wand of Death for any air elemental that got close.

Plane of fire is where life started to suck. First I got caught in a pool of
lava and wondered if I was going to starve to death there. No ok, I
continued to look for the portal. Oh yhea I need to bring a way to find that
damn thing next time. As I searched I ran in to my new least favorite
monster. Archon. It summoned, it blinded, it stunned. It made my life a
living hell. Almost died here, went off to a corner and surounded myself
with fire elementals to heal up. Oh look, Rodney decided to make an
appearence. Well after killing him, I floated over his body and looked. Oh
he got the amulet. Tried to take off my ring of levitation. Oh it's cursed.
Swell. Panic time. Ok think, can I pray? Well I'm not in hell and I don't
have the amulet so I don't see why not. Pray... Thanks Crom I guess your
still mad about the time I kicked the alter. Go to rgrn and ask the sages
what to do. Post is written, and I remember I might have a scroll of remove
cures. What luck I do and its blessed. Found the portal.

Water, well first I want to ask what the hell is a fire elemental doing
here. Anyway whoever decided to use this plane is evil. I died here.

